# S5's "must" is read as inferential ("therefore there is"), not as metaphysical necessity, so no modal logic is used.
atom	graded	among beings there are some more and some less good, true, noble and the like
atom	maximum_exists	there is something which is truest, something best, something noblest
atom	uttermost_being	there is something which is uttermost being
atom	cause_exists	there is something which is to all beings the cause of their being, goodness, and every other perfection
atom	god	there is God
P1	S2	graded	kind empirical
# S3: more and less are predicated according to resemblance to something which is the maximum.
